{{Quote|In addition, the space area between Tatooine, Roon and Ryloth in the Outer Rim known as the "Spice Triangle" is firmly in the hands of the Pykes.|"[[Index of Organizations]]"|<ref name="Organizations">{{GermanFanCite|116|Database}}</ref>}}
The '''Spice Triangle''' was an area of [[Realspace|space]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]] of [[the galaxy]] that contained three [[spice]] [[hyperspace route]]s. One leg of the triangle from [[Roon]] to [[Ryloth]] was the [[Death Wind Corridor]], another was the [[Corellian Run]] from [[Ryloth]] to [[Tatooine]], and the third was the [[Triellus Trade Route]] from [[Tatooine]] to [[Roon]]. It was controlled by the [[Pyke Syndicate]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide">''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]''</ref>

